@startuml
title Security camera and guardian drone (puppetMasterGuardian)
[*] --> Patrolling : camera spawns guardianCount drones\nfirst tick
state Patrolling : follows the walls\naround the camera
state Fighting : next to the player: hurts them\nclear row or column: shoots\nelse chases
state Checking : walks to where the player\nwas last seen (trail)
state Leashed : too far from the camera\nwalks back

Patrolling --> Fighting : sees the player within cameraSight\n(goe::sight, no seeing through walls)
Patrolling --> Checking : camera reports a sighting
Fighting --> Checking : player slips out of sight
Checking --> Fighting : sees the player
Checking --> Patrolling : player not there
Fighting --> Leashed : beyond the leash (55 cells)
Checking --> Leashed : beyond the leash
Leashed --> Patrolling : back within reach
Patrolling --> [*] : drone destroyed
Fighting --> [*] : drone destroyed
@enduml
